 "custom_css": "/* =====================================================================\n   Graphics Storm Studio \u2013 GLOBAL utility CSS (the ONLY custom CSS on the site)\n   Paste into: Elementor \u2192 Site Settings \u2192 Custom CSS\n   Everything else (colours, fonts, borders, radius, shadow, padding,\n   hover transforms, sticky header) is set natively in Elementor.\n   This file only adds what Elementor has no control for.\n   Usage: type the class name in  Advanced \u2192 CSS Classes  of a Container/Widget.\n   ===================================================================== */\n\n/* ---- 1. Glass panels (backdrop blur is not a native Elementor control) ---- */\n/* .gs-glass          \u2013 standard frosted card (set bg rgba(255,255,255,.06),\n                         1px border rgba(255,255,255,.14), radius 20, shadow natively) */\n/* .gs-glass--strong  \u2013 heavier blur for hero panels / forms (bg .10 natively) */\n.gs-glass,\n.gs-glass--strong {\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(140%);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(16px) saturate(140%);\n}\n.gs-glass--strong {\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(26px) saturate(160%);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(26px) saturate(160%);\n}\n/* Fallback: browsers without backdrop-filter get an opaque navy panel so text\n   contrast stays WCAG AA (Elementor's translucent bg is overridden only here). */\n@supports not ((backdrop-filter: blur(1px)) or (-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(1px))) {\n  .gs-glass, .gs-glass--strong, .gs-glass-header.elementor-sticky--effects {\n    background-color: rgba(12, 19, 48, 0.94) !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---- 2. Sticky glass header ---------------------------------------------- */\n/* Header container: Motion Effects \u2192 Sticky: Top, Effects Offset: 60.\n   Elementor Pro adds .elementor-sticky--effects after the offset; we blur it. */\n.gs-glass-header {\n  transition: background-color .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease, padding .3s ease;\n}\n.gs-glass-header.elementor-sticky--effects {\n  background-color: rgba(7, 11, 31, 0.72) !important;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.35);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(150%);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(150%);\n}\n\n/* ---- 3. Decorative colour blobs ------------------------------------------ */\n/* Empty container: Position Absolute, size + radial/solid bg set natively.\n   .gs-blob only blurs it and keeps it behind content / non-clickable. */\n.gs-blob {\n  filter: blur(80px);\n  opacity: .55;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  z-index: 0 !important;\n}\n.gs-blob ~ .e-con, .gs-blob ~ .elementor-element { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n\n/* ---- 4. Gradient text for the highlighted word in headings --------------- */\n/* Wrap the word in <span> inside a Heading widget and add class .gs-grad   */\n.gs-grad .elementor-heading-title span {\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #5DB0D8 0%, #0684C4 45%, #9D86FF 100%);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  background-clip: text;\n  color: transparent;\n}\n\n/* ---- 5. Forms on dark glass (placeholder colour has no global control) ---- */\n.gs-form ::placeholder { color: #A9B6D3; opacity: 1; }\n.gs-form .elementor-field-option label { color: #DCE4F5; }\n\n/* ---- 6. Accessibility ------------------------------------------------------ */\n/* Visible keyboard focus everywhere (WCAG 2.4.7) */\na:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible,\nselect:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible, [tabindex]:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid #5DB0D8;\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n/* Respect users who turn animations off */\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  *, *::before, *::after {\n    animation-duration: .01ms !important;\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\n    transition-duration: .01ms !important;\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---- 7. Global safety: no horizontal scroll from blobs/animations --------- */\nhtml, body { overflow-x: clip; }\n"
}